# Recorder

TLC reached more states than the chart budget of 500, so the chart draws only the bug paths: 14 states and 13 arrows.

## R03a_StoppedClicksAreUntouched breaks
The shortest path has 5 steps:
0. Not recording | gate off in the page
1. you press Record: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
2. the page switches the gate on: Recording | gate ON in the page
3. you press Stop: Wrapping up to pause | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
4. the recorder finishes wrapping up: Paused | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
5. you click (click 1): the gate holds it back: Paused | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way) | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet; no report; not in the timeline

## R01_HeldClickReachesThePageOnce breaks
The shortest path has 6 steps:
0. Not recording | gate off in the page
1. you press Record: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
2. the page switches the gate on: Recording | gate ON in the page
3. you press Clear: Wrapping up to clear | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
4. you stop the recorder from the terminal: Wrapping up to clear and end | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
5. the recorder finishes wrapping up: Ended: nothing to save | gate ON in the page
6. you click (click 1): the gate holds it back: Ended: nothing to save | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet; no report; not in the timeline

## R03b_StoppedAddsNothing breaks
The shortest path has 9 steps:
0. Not recording | gate off in the page
1. you press Record: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
2. the page switches the gate on: Recording | gate ON in the page
3. you press Stop: Wrapping up to pause | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
4. the recorder finishes wrapping up: Paused | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way)
5. you click (click 1): the gate holds it back: Paused | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way) | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet; no report; not in the timeline
6. you press Continue: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet; no report; not in the timeline
7. the recorder takes the 'before' of click 1: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, 'before' taken; no report; not in the timeline
8. the recorder passes click 1 on to the page: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: reached the page; report on its way; not in the timeline
9. Playwright's report for 1 arrives: added to the timeline: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: reached the page; report in; in the timeline (before 2, after -)

